    "architecturalHeights": "Exact-QID way1115403900/Q733577 matches current PMTiles main35185487492732. Its30-vertex raw outline/tags retain height8m and absent min_height. The8m whole-building tag is inconsistent with the pictured spires and high nave; it is retained as coarse map metadata, not used as an overall roof or spire limit. No surveyed dimensions are retained. All heights are picture estimates: nave/choir/transept eave14.5m, nave ridge19.5m/transept19.5m/choir18.5m, lower chapel wall8m/roofs10.5m, west-south tower square20m/octagon29m/needle44.4m/cross45.5m, smaller crossing tower22m/needle26.4m/cross27.4m. Raw outline rotates rigidly; internal subplans and Boolean inputs quantized0.1mm subdivide/approximate it without rescale. Rear chapel/roof joins, north fenestration, carving and thresholds remain approximate."
